adaptation-google-bramble (1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of Google Pixel 4a (5G) (bramble) Droidian adaptation.
  * Turnip Vulkan 1.3 60fps GPU acceleration via /dev/kgsl-3d0.
  * Phosh with GSK_RENDERER=ngl and Phoc with WLR_RENDERER=vulkan.
  * BrambleGate Cairo 2D mobile boot manager.
  * Mask android-composer to prevent DRM master contention.

